  ✓ add
  ✗ subtract
    expect(received).toBe(expected)
    Expected: 2
    Received: 8
  ✓ multiply
  Tests: 1 failed, 2 passed, 3 total`,
          `FAIL ./calculator.test.js
  ✗ add
    expect(received).toBe(expected)
    Expected: 4
    Received: 22
